   Q('mcq', 'According to Leila, the date palms help the plants below them by', 'C', 'protect the lower plants from the wind, so less water evaporates', 'They reduce wind and evaporation.', opts=['adding nutrients to the soil.', 'attracting insects that pollinate them.', 'reducing the loss of water.']),
